# === Cargo / Rust build artifacts ===
# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# cargo.lock – ignore for libraries / reusable crates
cargo.lock

# === Rustfmt backups ===
**/*.rs.bk

# === MSVC debug symbols ===
*.pdb

# === cargo-mutants output ===
**/mutants.out*/

# === JetBrains / RustRover ===
# See: https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#.idea/

# === Emacs / Flycheck temporary files ===
# Flycheck creates these in the same directory as your .rs files
flycheck_*.rs
flycheck[0-9]*   # e.g. flycheck0main.rs, flycheck1lib.rs, …
*~               # Emacs backup files